      "message": "+1\n\nI\u0027m trying to understand why this need to be exposed as @SystemApi. Could you point me to the code block where ConnectivityService uses this? Unfortunately, these rules got a bit ugly with the recent addition of restricted mode. I\u0027d really like to explore a way to better way to deal with it.",
