      "writtenOn": "2021-02-02T02:15:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is used for aosp/1536731 and ConnectivityService. In aosp/1536731, I add a new utility class NetworkPolicyUtils and move some common parameters and methods here. And NetworkPolicyUtils can use formal or system api only, so I need to expose some NetworkPolicyManager API here.",
